<view wx:if="{{show}}" class="account-mask" catchtouchmove="noop"><view class="account-sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="account-head"><view><view class="account-title">账户与隐私</view><view class="account-email">当前账号：{{currentEmail}}</view></view><button class="account-close" bindtap="close">关闭</button></view><scroll-view class="account-scroll" scroll-y><view class="privacy-card"><view class="privacy-title">隐私说明</view><view>图研Tuyan 仅为登录、任务所有权与结果资产保存处理必要账号信息。API Key 只存在当前页面内存，不进入 Storage、日志或任务记录。</view></view><button class="logout-button" bindtap="logout">退出当前账号</button><view class="danger-zone"><view class="danger-title">永久删除账号</view><view class="danger-note">删除前必须重输当前邮箱和密码，并完成两次确认。成功后会清理 Cookie、草稿、任务缓存和内存密钥。</view><input class="danger-input" value="{{email}}" placeholder="重输当前邮箱" bindinput="onEmailInput" /><input class="danger-input" password value="{{password}}" placeholder="重输当前密码" bindinput="onPasswordInput" /><checkbox-group bindchange="onConfirmChange"><label class="danger-confirm"><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{confirmed}}" color="#9c3e31" />我理解删除不可撤销</label></checkbox-group><view class="account-error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="delete-button" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{deleting}}" bindtap="deleteAccount">永久删除账号</button></view></scroll-view></view></view>
